---
/**
 * Testimonials , Wall of Love
 * Per 2026 playbook: before→after metric format, photos, specific metrics
 * Davie Fogarty now lives in CaseStudies , this is the supporting wall
 */
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import imgHorseEducationProof from "../assets/case-studies/horse-education-slack-proof.png";

const testimonials = [
  // Most recognizable brands first
  {
    quote: "Teaming up with e2 for our SMS marketing has been an absolute game-changer. Their innovative strategies and personalised approach resulted in engaging SMS campaigns that resonated deeply with our audience. Their expertise in Shopify allowed us to optimise Postscript campaigns, translating to remarkable conversion rate increases and substantial revenue growth.",
    author: "Paddy Kennedy",
    role: "Marketing Manager",
    company: "The Oodie",
    before: "Flat",
    after: "Growing",
    metricLabel: "SMS revenue + conversion rates",
  },
  {
    quote: "Jason has been advising brands inside The Daily Mentor community for 6 months now, and I don't think there's a better person to help founders grow their brands through email and SMS. He doesn't just advise from a distance, he gets his hands dirty coaching founders not just on what to do, but how to do it. The results founders are getting is WILD.",
    author: "KC Holiday",
    role: "Former CEO",
    company: "The Daily Mentor · Founder, Cashmere Wolf",
    before: "Good",
    after: "WILD",
    metricLabel: "Community-wide results",
  },
  {
    quote: "Migrated us to Klaviyo, built our SMS list from zero to 30,000 subscribers, and scaled campaign revenue from $5k to $40k/month. Over $1M in SMS revenue generated.",
    author: "Hodgetwins Team",
    role: "Verified",
    company: "The Hodgetwins · Patriotic Merch",
    before: "10%",
    after: "50%",
    metricLabel: "Email + SMS revenue share",
  },
  // Big multipliers
  {
    quote: "E2 casually 10X'd our results from our welcome flow like it was nothing. Overhauled all aspects of our email/SMS and dramatically improved results on all facets. Their systems are extremely smooth and overall a joy to work with. Pull the trigger, you will not regret it.",
    author: "Jaya Powell",
    role: "Strategy",
    company: "Awareness Avenue",
    before: "1x",
    after: "10x",
    metricLabel: "Welcome flow results",
  },
  {
    quote: "E2 agency is by far the best agency we've worked with as a multi 7 figure brand. They added 30-40% to our top line revenue. If you want results like that, you need to go with E2.",
    author: "Colin",
    role: "Owner/CEO",
    company: "Fleecies · Fashion & Apparel",
    before: "~20%",
    after: "~40%+",
    metricLabel: "Email % of total revenue",
  },
  {
    quote: "Jason managed to make our EDM sales grow from 25% to 48% of total revenue. I genuinely thought we were doing great prior to them. e2 is the 🐐.",
    author: "Alice Robert",
    role: "Founder",
    company: "The Littl · Jewellery",
    before: "25%",
    after: "48%",
    metricLabel: "EDM revenue share · 6 months",
  },
  {
    quote: "Before we started with them, emails kept going to junk folders and weren't being opened. Since joining e2 and collaborating with Jason, we now have a very high through rate and we've 2X'd our revenue in terms of email marketing. Jump on it, guys.",
    author: "Jaydan Brennan",
    role: "Owner",
    company: "Hercules Supps · Australian eCommerce",
    before: "14%",
    after: "43%",
    metricLabel: "Total email revenue · under 60 days",
  },
  {
    quote: "Within our first month, our attributed revenue from Klaviyo went from 5% to 32%. After 3 months it's now 40%. Communication couldn't be quicker, organisation is top notch and the design is 10/10!",
    author: "Gemma Elliott",
    role: "Owner/Founder",
    company: "Luscious Living Co",
    before: "5%",
    after: "40%",
    metricLabel: "Klaviyo attributed revenue",
  },
  {
    quote: "The list existed. The revenue didn't. We built their first campaign system, ran BFCM weekend, and the list did exactly what a list is supposed to do.",
    author: "e2 Agency",
    role: "Verified via Klaviyo",
    company: "Nursery Near Me · Home & Garden eCommerce",
    before: "$0",
    after: "$44k",
    metricLabel: "BFCM campaign revenue · dormant list",
  },
  {
    quote: "e2 made a huge impact on our email performance. They lifted our open rates from under 15% to over 50% and turned the channel into a real growth driver. Sharp, responsive, and results-focused from start to finish.",
    author: "Adam C",
    role: "Head of Marketing",
    company: "Nexus Sports Nutrition · Supplements",
    before: "15%",
    after: "50%+",
    metricLabel: "Email open rate · 4 months",
  },
  {
    quote: "Our revenue from campaigns grew 3x while e2 was in charge. Irina's professionalism and creative approach never ceased to please me. Absolute pleasure to work with.",
    author: "Marina Kalenchyts",
    role: "Brand Director",
    company: "Wonderskin",
    before: "1x",
    after: "3x",
    metricLabel: "Campaign revenue",
  },
  {
    quote: "We've more than tripled our email optin rate and gotten a ton of SMS optins. Jason knows Klaviyo and ecommerce email marketing inside out. No matter if you're doing $50k or $1M+ per month, hire him, you won't be disappointed.",
    author: "Dima Kritchevski",
    role: "Brand Owner",
    company: "DTC Brand",
    before: "1x",
    after: "3x+",
    metricLabel: "Email opt-in rate",
  },
  {
    quote: "Jason thinks outside of the box, which sets him apart from everyone else. He didn't just hand over a blueprint. He remained fully invested in the implementation every step of the way.",
    author: "Gary",
    role: "Manager",
    company: "Brand House Direct",
    before: "Low",
    after: "Growing",
    metricLabel: "Open rates, CTR & deliverability",
  },
];
---

<section class="py-32 relative w-full overflow-x-hidden">
  <div class="section-container w-full min-w-0 max-w-full">

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 sm:mb-16 px-0.5">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 mb-4">Client Results</p>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-[clamp(1.5rem,6vw,3rem)] md:text-5xl text-e2-black tracking-tight mb-4 text-balance">
        750+ Build-Outs.<br/>
        <span class="text-gray-600">Here's What Happened.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Horse Education — same card pattern as grid; screenshot sits under quote -->
    <div class="mb-10 sm:mb-14 w-full min-w-0 max-w-full">
      <div
        class="glass-panel p-5 sm:p-8 rounded-[2rem] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-100/50 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col w-full min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden border border-gray-100"
      >
        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 mb-5 sm:mb-6 w-full min-w-0"
        >
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-center w-full">
            <div
              class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-600 tracking-tight break-words"
            >
              Overwhelmed
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
              Before
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg
            class="w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 rotate-90 sm:rotate-0"
            fill="none"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            stroke="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path>
          </svg>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-center w-full">
            <div
              class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-e2-black tracking-tight break-words"
            >
              Present
            </div>
            <div
              class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
              After
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p
          class="text-[10px] text-blue-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 text-center sm:text-left break-words leading-snug"
        >
          Holiday season · email program
        </p>

        <blockquote
          class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1 text-sm min-w-0 break-words text-pretty"
        >
          &ldquo;Thank you merry Christmas to you all and thanks for all the
          great work- we got so many compliments on the emails and you made a
          huge difference in my life. Last year I was in constant tears this
          time of year and this year I have actually gotten to have a life and
          enjoy the holiday myself a little. xx&rdquo;
        </blockquote>

        <figure
          class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200/80 bg-gray-50 mb-6 w-full min-w-0"
        >
          <Image
            src={imgHorseEducationProof}
            widths={[400, 800, 1024]}
            sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 400px"
            quality={70}
            alt="Original message from Sara at Horse Education."
            class="w-full h-auto block"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>

        <div
          class="flex items-start gap-3 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 min-w-0"
        >
          <div
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-black text-gray-600 flex-shrink-0"
          >
            S
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm min-w-0 flex-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-e2-black block break-words">Sara</span>
            <span class="text-gray-600 text-xs block break-words leading-snug"
              >Horse Education</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Masonry grid — min-w-0 so grid items respect viewport (fixes mobile horizontal clip) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full min-w-0">
      {
        testimonials.map((t) => (
          <div class="glass-panel p-5 sm:p-8 rounded-[2rem] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-100/50 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col w-full min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden">

            <!-- Before → After: vertical on mobile (no horizontal squeeze), row on sm+ -->
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 mb-5 sm:mb-6 w-full min-w-0">
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-center w-full">
                <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-gray-600 tracking-tight break-words">{t.before}</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Before</div>
              </div>
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 rotate-90 sm:rotate-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-center w-full">
                <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-e2-black tracking-tight break-words">{t.after}</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">After</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-[10px] text-blue-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 text-center sm:text-left break-words leading-snug">{t.metricLabel}</p>

            <blockquote class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1 text-sm min-w-0 break-words text-pretty">
              "{t.quote}"
            </blockquote>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 min-w-0">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-black text-gray-600 flex-shrink-0">
                {t.author.charAt(0)}
              </div>
              <div class="text-sm min-w-0 flex-1">
                <span class="font-bold text-e2-black block break-words">{t.author}</span>
                <span class="text-gray-600 text-xs block break-words leading-snug">{t.role}, {t.company}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <!-- Aggregate trust metric -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center px-0.5">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-balance break-words">
        Based on <strong class="text-e2-black">750+</strong> flow builds across eCom brands in AU, NZ, UK &amp; USA.
        Average client email contribution to revenue <strong class="text-e2-black">increases 31%</strong> within 90 days.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
